---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — Güven Gürsel">
  <section class="bio">
    <p class="bio-lead"><em>Two careers, one thread.</em></p>

    <p class="bio-body">
      First: six years in digital agencies, shipping web products
      and managing delivery for major brands. Then: a decade in
      the field — hydropower plant assembly, mechanical
      commissioning, turbine start-up, and eventually service
      operations across 30+ countries.
    </p>

    <p class="bio-body">
      Most people in industrial operations have never built a web
      product. Most people in tech have never stood inside a
      turbine housing. I've done both.
    </p>

    <p class="bio-body">
      Now I'm connecting the two — building digital tools for the
      kind of operations I know from the inside.
    </p>

    <p class="bio-closer"><em>Tools that actually work — for the
      people managing the work, not just reporting on it.</em></p>
  </section>

  <section class="skills">
    <div class="skills-group">
      <h3 class="skills-label">Operations &amp; Engineering</h3>
      <ul class="skills-tags">
        <li>Hydropower commissioning</li>
        <li>O&amp;M management</li>
        <li>LTSA / SLA</li>
        <li>Field coordination</li>
        <li>EHS &amp; ISO 9001</li>
        <li>Warranty &amp; claims</li>
        <li>30+ countries</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="skills-group">
      <h3 class="skills-label">Digital &amp; Creative</h3>
      <ul class="skills-tags">
        <li>HTML5 / CSS3 / JS</li>
        <li>Photoshop</li>
        <li>Illustrator</li>
        <li>Premiere</li>
        <li>After Effects</li>
        <li>Project delivery</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="skills-group">
      <h3 class="skills-label">AI &amp; Tools</h3>
      <ul class="skills-tags">
        <li>Claude API</li>
        <li>Azure</li>
        <li>Copilot Studio</li>
        <li>Prompt Engineering</li>
        <li>VS Code</li>
        <li>Notion</li>
        <li>Obsidian</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="skills-group">
      <h3 class="skills-label">Languages</h3>
      <ul class="skills-tags">
        <li>Turkish — native</li>
        <li>English — C1</li>
        <li>German — A1, improving</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="resume">
    <a class="nav-link" href="mailto:contact@guvengursel.com">
      contact@guvengursel.com
    </a>
  </section>
</Layout>
